-So sweet.

82
00:03:53,274 --> 00:03:55,193
-I love that.
-I'm trying to be honest all the way.

83
00:03:55,276 --> 00:03:57,278
-Amen.
-I don't want to set the bar super high

84
00:03:57,362 --> 00:03:59,238
