92
00:04:13,836 --> 00:04:16,172
-Oh, sweet.
-But I'm Latino, so...

93
00:04:16,255 --> 00:04:17,548
Latino. I love that.

94
00:04:17,632 --> 00:04:19,634
My mom is from Honduras
and my dad's from Guatemala.

95
00:04:19,717 --> 00:04:22,637
I love it.
You've got a good little mix there.

96
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,138
