139
00:05:50,141 --> 00:05:52,143
-I'm five-foot. There's like...
-[laughs]

140
00:05:52,226 --> 00:05:54,270
-Just was not on the cards for me.
-Not in the cards.

141
00:05:55,021 --> 00:05:56,272
