159
00:06:38,648 --> 00:06:40,650
Your hair's beautiful.
I wouldn't touch it.

160
00:06:40,733 --> 00:06:41,943
Thank you. I grew it myself.

161
00:06:42,068 --> 00:06:43,945
Long, beautiful, Sicilian hair.
You're beautiful.

162
00:06:44,028 --> 00:06:46,614
Aw. Thank you. You're very handsome, too.

163
00:06:46,697 --> 00:06:47,532
Thank you.

164
