192
00:07:57,685 --> 00:08:00,605
So it's not even just red meat?
It's no chicken, no turkey?

193
00:08:00,688 --> 00:08:01,898
No dead animals.

194
00:08:01,981 --> 00:08:03,316
-No dead animals?
-Yeah.

195
00:08:03,399 --> 00:08:04,692
[both laughing]

196
00:08:04,775 --> 00:08:05,735
It's just who I am.

197
00:08:05,818 --> 00:08:08,070
So you hunt, obviously.

198
00:08:08,529 --> 00:08:11,616
- Uh, yes.  I-- I-- I enjoy hunting.
-Mm-hmm.

199
00:08:11,741 --> 00:08:13,117
